WEBVTT

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.200
<i>C'mon, morning's here--time to be on our way</i>

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:24.700
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:29.830
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>No turning back: this trip is nonfiction</i>

00:00:29.830 --> 00:00:35.080
<i>You ready or not? Ready or not, go!</i>
<i>It's now or never, the real deal: Ready, and... action!</i>

00:00:35.080 --> 00:00:40.540
<i>Harsh winds that make us hesitate,</i>
<i>nights spent crying our eyes out</i>

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:45.790
<i>They're not necessarily bad things (not bad)</i>

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:51.500
<i>Just like the power in a spring:</i>
<i>the harder we're pushed</i>

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:55.040
<i>The higher we can fly</i>

00:00:55.040 --> 00:01:05.580
<i>Face the far-off distance</i>
<i>and aim for the horizon: rising sun</i>

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.870
<i>Holding our hands up to that morning sun</i>

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:21.250
<i>Our shared feelings brought us together--</i>
<i>we're not alone anymore</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:27.450
<i>And so we're on this brilliant voyage</i>

00:01:27.450 --> 00:01:34.250
<i>Smiling faces, courage,</i>
<i>we're bustin' out: glory days!</i>

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:41.620
Under the rule of Ei Sei,
the King who worked toward unification,

00:01:41.620 --> 00:01:44.370
the Kingdom of Chin launched
an invasion of the land of Gi.

00:01:45.410 --> 00:01:49.330
Their opponent: the legendary general Ren Pa.

00:01:49.330 --> 00:01:52.160
The young commanders stepped
onto a relentless battlefield,

00:01:52.160 --> 00:01:54.870
their sights set on a major victory.

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:04.200
Tomorrow, the Gaku Ka Force,
the Gyoku Hou Force, and the Hi Shin Unit

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:05.410
will take out Rin Ko!

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:08.410
Let's talk strategy.

00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:13.370
First the Gaku Ka Force goes
after Rin Ko's main camp alone...

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:16.580
Now!

00:02:19.040 --> 00:02:20.040
What?!

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.120
Phase one of our strategy:

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:31.500
The Gaku Ka Force... will <i>not</i> go after Rin Ko!

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:38.040
"Three Forces United"

00:02:42.000 --> 00:02:45.750
A mere eight hundred troops,
split into five teams...

00:02:47.370 --> 00:02:50.410
What are they trying to do,
coming after the main camp

00:02:50.410 --> 00:02:52.370
with its five thousand men?

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:55.950
Okay! We're going in!

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:02.370
And they're waltzing right in, are they?

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.950
This is no clever plan--this is plain bizarre!

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:08.580
They're charging to their death.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:12.080
Mou Gou, sir! It's the young lord!

00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:14.250
The Gaku Ka Force is attacking
the enemy's main camp--alone!

00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:20.120
Mou Ten... what on earth...

00:03:20.120 --> 00:03:21.830
Call them back at once!

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:22.830
Yes, sir!

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:25.200
No--wait.

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:26.200
Sir?

00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:31.830
Father... about Mou Ten.

00:03:31.830 --> 00:03:35.160
Is he still to remain a
three-hundred-man commander?

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:37.870
Being overprotective will stunt his growth.

00:03:37.870 --> 00:03:41.660
As will too much neglect.

00:03:41.660 --> 00:03:44.250
You should trust him more.

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:49.950
He may be a girlish lad,
but I see far more in him

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.750
than in those thousand-men commanders.

00:03:52.750 --> 00:03:56.540
You should understand that
more than anyone, Father.

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:00.910
Trust in Mou Ten.

00:04:00.910 --> 00:04:05.870
If he dies, he dies--but he dies a man.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:08.040
Mou Ten...

00:04:08.040 --> 00:04:10.790
Grandpa, look! See? A crab!

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.700
Take a message to General Do Mon.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:19.750
Sir!

00:04:19.750 --> 00:04:22.160
"The Gaku Ka Force are independent reserves.

00:04:22.160 --> 00:04:25.000
Let them go on doing as they wish."

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:27.250
B-But, sir...

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.120
Go.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.450
Yes, sir!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:34.700
I know, Mou Ten...

00:04:34.700 --> 00:04:40.200
I know you are the most gifted
in three generations of Meng soldiers.

00:04:41.450 --> 00:04:42.660
But...

00:04:46.500 --> 00:04:49.330
you <i>cannot</i> die in vain!

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:53.540
The enemy is launching an unexpected invasion!

00:04:53.540 --> 00:04:55.160
What is the meaning of this?!

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:57.660
They're aiming at the seams
in our defense, of course.

00:04:59.330 --> 00:05:04.330
If that's their plan,
it's really not much of one.

00:05:04.330 --> 00:05:06.450
After all, those spots are covered...

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.500
...by soldiers with a hundred
battles under their belts.

00:05:20.370 --> 00:05:21.750
Mou Ten, sir!

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:23.160
Yeah!

00:05:23.160 --> 00:05:25.450
There they are: Rin Ko's men!

00:05:29.870 --> 00:05:33.250
The infantry should be able
to handle things here.

00:05:33.250 --> 00:05:36.250
The cavalry can move out at any time, Shin!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.250
Shin?

00:05:40.830 --> 00:05:42.160
Huh?!

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:44.830
You're <i>not</i> goin' after Rin Ko?

00:05:44.830 --> 00:05:47.700
What the hell, Mou Ten?!

00:05:47.700 --> 00:05:51.450
Come tomorrow, the Gaku Ka Force's target

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.290
will be Rin Ko's men.

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:54.290
Wha--?

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:59.620
Rin Ko's men?
You're sayin' we go after his troops?

00:05:59.620 --> 00:06:00.700
That's right.

00:06:00.700 --> 00:06:02.750
Whaddya mean, "that's right"?!

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:05.790
Rin Ko is a monster, to be sure.

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:12.250
But he alone can't destroy enemies
by the hundreds or thousands.

00:06:12.250 --> 00:06:16.620
Behind Rin Ko are the troops
who always fight beside him,

00:06:16.620 --> 00:06:19.000
battle after battle, without fail.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.410
Indeed, Rin Ko's destructive power
is in commanding those troops.

00:06:24.040 --> 00:06:25.750
When Rin Ko was exiled,

00:06:25.750 --> 00:06:28.950
he brought seven hundred
specially chosen soldiers with him to Gi.

00:06:29.950 --> 00:06:33.620
During this battle,
they've been surrounding Rin Ko,

00:06:33.620 --> 00:06:36.500
waiting to charge.

00:06:36.500 --> 00:06:40.370
The Gaku Ka Force will go after
those seven hundred troops

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.830
and take them out.

00:06:41.830 --> 00:06:48.160
Then Rin Ko has no real way
to strike Mou Gou's main camp.

00:06:49.870 --> 00:06:51.040
Well,

00:06:51.040 --> 00:06:55.080
I guess it's more about laying some groundwork.

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:56.500
Groundwork?

00:06:56.500 --> 00:06:58.410
It's not that easy.

00:06:59.700 --> 00:07:02.870
The Gyoku Hou Force fought them that first day.

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:07.750
They bested us in both
individual <i>and</i> group strength.

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:17.120
You want to get the jump on the
unstoppable Rin Ko and his troops.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:21.410
But if you challenge them, the only one
who'll wind up with casualties

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:24.080
is the Gaku Ka Force, Mou Ten.

00:07:27.950 --> 00:07:31.450
Why aren't we mobilizing, Shin?

00:07:31.450 --> 00:07:35.540
Aren't we supposed to be fighting
alongside the Gaku Ka Force?

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:36.910
Why, if this keeps up, they'll--

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:38.790
Stay put and wait for the signal!

00:07:41.620 --> 00:07:44.200
This is all part of Mou Ten's strategy.

00:07:45.500 --> 00:07:49.790
Ou Hon, sir, it seems the
Gaku Ka Force is struggling.

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:52.700
Perhaps this strategy was a mistake.

00:07:52.700 --> 00:07:55.500
No, I don't think so.

00:07:55.500 --> 00:08:00.700
You need an attack framework
to take down big game like Rin Ko.

00:08:00.700 --> 00:08:03.870
An attack framework?

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:10.660
When we attack Rin Ko, his powerful troops
will prove a huge obstacle.

00:08:10.660 --> 00:08:14.250
Mou Ten is trying to get rid of them first.

00:08:15.750 --> 00:08:20.790
Of course, this is no simple task. Still...

00:08:20.790 --> 00:08:25.500
he's the one who took on this prep work,
drawing first blood...

00:08:27.370 --> 00:08:30.620
You've really made up your mind,
haven't you, Mou Ten.

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:35.370
The ever-temperamental Gaku Ka Force...

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:37.750
Once you show your enthusiasm at the forefront,

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:43.580
they'll get worked up into a lather,

00:08:43.580 --> 00:08:46.000
and put more than their usual muscle on display.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:50.290
What gives, men? Tired already?

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:04.160
My soldiers--being killed?

00:09:07.750 --> 00:09:09.700
W-Wait a second here!

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:13.450
What gives, Mou Ten?
Why do <i>you</i> hafta be our stepping-stone,

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:16.160
sacrificin' yourself like that?

00:09:16.160 --> 00:09:20.500
Silly. I'm not setting out
to be some martyr here.

00:09:20.500 --> 00:09:23.330
It's just that the Gyoku Hou and
Hi Shin Units as they are today

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:27.250
can't fulfill this vital role.

00:09:27.250 --> 00:09:31.540
Only the Gaku Ka Force can. And we will--

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:35.870
All to bring down Rin Ko!

00:09:37.120 --> 00:09:38.830
We three forces together, that is!

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:43.660
All right, it's time!

00:09:49.870 --> 00:09:50.870
Is that--

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:54.450
Ou Hon, Shin...

00:09:54.450 --> 00:09:57.160
the rest is up to you!

00:09:57.160 --> 00:09:59.290
That's the signal, Shin!

00:10:00.950 --> 00:10:03.540
C'mon, Hi Shin Unit!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.450
Let's go, Gyoku Hou Force!

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:12.620
Will the infantry be all right back there?

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:15.370
The sergeants know the gist of our plan.

00:10:15.370 --> 00:10:17.370
The bigger issue here

00:10:17.370 --> 00:10:22.540
is whether we can reach Rin Ko
before the Gaku Ka Force is defeated.

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:31.250
Mou Ten, sir!

00:10:31.250 --> 00:10:32.830
We're hurting pretty bad!

00:10:32.830 --> 00:10:36.830
If we lose any more men,
we'll fall apart completely!

00:10:36.830 --> 00:10:39.250
I know!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:43.410
But Rin Ko's troops
have thinned out plenty, too.

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.950
Pull my soldiers back and have them assemble.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:49.910
Y-Your soldiers, sir?

00:10:49.910 --> 00:10:52.410
Yes. And hurry.

00:10:52.410 --> 00:10:55.660
Fill those holes with new Gi recruits.

00:10:55.660 --> 00:10:58.830
Strengthen the perimeter--
and don't let a single one escape.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:11:00.790
Yes, sir!

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:06.000
Oh, dear... this whole time,
they were coming after my men.

00:11:06.000 --> 00:11:10.540
Such precious implements--
and I only have so many of them.

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:18.370
Forget the small fry!
Just plow through and send 'em flyin'!

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:23.330
What's this?

00:11:25.120 --> 00:11:26.700
The enemy's reaction to us--

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:29.330
It's markedly slow!

00:11:29.330 --> 00:11:32.250
The chinks! Find a chink and run through it!

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:37.750
We might just be able to do this!

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:40.620
Keep up this pace and
we can make up for lost time!

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:42.370
I know!

00:11:42.370 --> 00:11:46.750
Like I said: it's all accordin' to plan!

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:52.020
"Rin Ko"

00:11:54.870 --> 00:11:57.950
They got a late start,
so we made it in time...?

00:11:57.950 --> 00:12:02.450
Right. When the Gaku Ka Force
suddenly ran out ahead,

00:12:02.450 --> 00:12:05.790
the enemy would have been watching
for other units to mobilize, too.

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.500
But it was only the Gaku Ka Force.

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:12.000
Their no-hesitation rush into
the Gi army's main camp

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.000
drew the enemy's attention.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.660
The later we mobilize,
the more the enemy would be focused

00:12:17.660 --> 00:12:21.540
on the Gaku Ka Force running wild in their midst.

00:12:23.000 --> 00:12:25.910
With no enemies in the cavalry's way,

00:12:25.910 --> 00:12:29.750
we can reach Rin Ko's camp
in the blink of an eye.

00:12:31.830 --> 00:12:33.790
The main camp! Let's go!

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:40.160
Mou Ten, sir, the Hi Shin
and Gyoku Hou forces are approaching!

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:41.290
Good!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:46.160
Then how about we give them
one more little present?

00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:50.500
Left and right flanks! Retreat at once!
We'll be backing down, too!

00:12:51.910 --> 00:12:52.950
They're running!

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.290
After them!

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:55.500
Don't let them get away!

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:02.160
He...

00:13:02.160 --> 00:13:04.660
He made us a path!

00:13:04.660 --> 00:13:08.080
O-Ou Hon, sir! Is this--

00:13:08.080 --> 00:13:13.950
Impossible... This, too,
is Mou Ten's doing? I can't believe it!

00:13:13.950 --> 00:13:18.870
Fighting like this with one
of Ren Pa's right-hand men...

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:24.700
And bringing three young rivals
together into one allied force?

00:13:25.830 --> 00:13:28.290
The talent that made him
our first thousand-man commander

00:13:28.290 --> 00:13:30.120
was clearly not just for show.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:36.410
In fact, Mou Ten's skills
may already be far beyond that level!

00:13:38.370 --> 00:13:42.500
A-another unit is closing in
from the left! About 300 strong!

00:13:42.500 --> 00:13:44.330
What?!

00:13:44.330 --> 00:13:45.950
And from the right, too!

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:48.500
Ridiculous! Since when?

00:13:48.500 --> 00:13:51.160
Look how far they've come already! General!

00:13:55.160 --> 00:13:56.580
Look!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:14:02.000
The main camp's flags!
Rin Ko's right in front of us!

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.000
Rin Ko...!

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:06.120
Rin Ko...

00:14:06.120 --> 00:14:08.450
Time to avenge Kaku Bi!

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.250
Out in front--they're coming!

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:14.250
What?!

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:19.200
Shit!

00:14:20.200 --> 00:14:22.540
They got us!

00:14:22.540 --> 00:14:24.410
Out of the way!

00:14:28.040 --> 00:14:30.700
What the--? They're crazy strong!

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:34.870
Soldiers in white... They can't be...

00:14:34.870 --> 00:14:36.500
Rin Ko's troops!

00:14:37.750 --> 00:14:39.000
Kill them all!

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:44.370
Rin Ko's soldiers--here, of all places!

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:47.700
Why didn't Mou Ten
take care of these goons?!

00:14:47.700 --> 00:14:51.370
They must be the last troops
guarding Rin Ko's perimeter.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:55.450
And they're certainly not holding back!
What audacity!

00:14:55.450 --> 00:14:58.200
Like one big wave of constant attack...

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:01.000
But if we can just make it through this,

00:15:01.000 --> 00:15:03.500
there'll be no one left to protect Rin Ko!

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:06.290
Hey!

00:15:07.870 --> 00:15:10.870
I <i>said</i> , get outta my way!

00:15:10.870 --> 00:15:13.750
All right! Almost there!

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:16.410
Commander! Look behind us!

00:15:16.410 --> 00:15:18.870
There's no one there--no one!

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:19.870
What?!

00:15:20.790 --> 00:15:26.450
What are you doing, Shin? Keep up the charge!

00:15:26.450 --> 00:15:29.540
Rin Ko is just trying to delay the inevitable!

00:15:29.540 --> 00:15:31.910
Shin, I know you can take him down!

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:35.370
So Sui!

00:15:39.540 --> 00:15:41.620
Go, Shin!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:46.200
Don't worry about us--go take Rin Ko's head!

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:48.700
So Sui...

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:50.950
Kill him!

00:15:53.080 --> 00:15:54.910
<i>Hurry</i> !

00:15:54.910 --> 00:15:57.160
So Sui!!

00:15:57.160 --> 00:15:58.870
I'll head back.

00:15:58.870 --> 00:16:00.160
Kyou Kai!

00:16:00.160 --> 00:16:03.950
The Hi Shin Unit still needs him.

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:10.290
Okay... he's all yours.

00:16:10.290 --> 00:16:12.040
And I...

00:16:12.040 --> 00:16:13.750
...am takin' down Rin Ko!

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:25.000
What hurts the most is losing
over half of my personal troops.

00:16:26.790 --> 00:16:31.200
Now I have to come up
with something for the main event.

00:16:32.870 --> 00:16:34.950
But that's all.

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:38.660
Everything else

00:16:40.910 --> 00:16:42.910
is unimportant.

00:16:48.910 --> 00:16:50.870
Even if the enemy does close in...

00:16:53.500 --> 00:16:55.870
...it's not like they'll kill me.

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:10.410
You all right, So Sui?

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.660
K-Kyou Kai?!

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:14.370
Why did you come back?

00:17:14.370 --> 00:17:17.500
I decided to pull back a little and fight here.

00:17:17.500 --> 00:17:20.000
You're not going with Shin?

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:24.410
Wouldn't want to lead
these Rin Ko troops right to him.

00:17:25.660 --> 00:17:29.120
Let Shin handle Rin Ko.

00:17:32.040 --> 00:17:38.330
Oh? Aren't you that
Hi Shin Unit fellow? That--

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:39.450
Shin.

00:17:42.410 --> 00:17:44.160
We meet again.

00:17:45.330 --> 00:17:48.370
And this time, you're not running away, Rin Ko.

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:54.120
It's the other way around.
I won't do you the <i>favor</i> of running.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:56.000
Say what?!

00:17:56.000 --> 00:17:59.160
You and Mr. Spearman there--

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:03.200
you've both entirely underestimated
your opponent's might.

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:09.790
Did you really think the two
of you could even touch me?

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:17.080
Quit screwin' around!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.120
Is that all you got?

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:32.870
I don't mind two at once,
but let's do this more efficiently.

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:36.410
You look easier to deal with--
I'll save you for later.

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:38.910
So the first one to take his lumps will be...

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:49.080
Ou Hon!

00:18:53.660 --> 00:18:54.660
Out of the way.

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:59.000
Yow!

00:18:59.000 --> 00:19:03.290
You're plenty determined,
but your wounds have taken the edge off.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:05.540
Bastard...

00:19:10.700 --> 00:19:13.290
Ooh, he's fast!

00:19:13.290 --> 00:19:16.580
Shin of the Hi Shin Unit...
if that's what you're up to,

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:17.910
then I have no choice.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.830
He's going for Shin!

00:19:20.830 --> 00:19:22.910
I guess I'll start with you.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:24.450
Stop! Shin!

00:19:39.290 --> 00:19:42.830
Who's underestimatin' who, now,

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:43.830
Rin Ko?

00:19:45.910 --> 00:19:50.660
I'll make damn sure you know
who's the strongest one here!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:57.540
Dammit! What's going on
with Rin Ko's main camp?

00:19:57.540 --> 00:20:01.330
The dust clouds from all the fighting
make it impossible to see!

00:20:01.330 --> 00:20:04.790
The Gaku Ka Force has withdrawn,
but the Gyoku Hou and Hi Shin Units

00:20:04.790 --> 00:20:06.540
have moved in instead!

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:10.370
Working with the Gaku Ka Force, I assume...

00:20:10.370 --> 00:20:13.950
And all three acting apart!

00:20:13.950 --> 00:20:17.620
They may be independent reserves,
but if they don't get results,

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:19.410
they'll have a lot to answer for!

00:20:21.080 --> 00:20:24.000
Well, naturally!

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:30.410
And I'm sure no one knows that
better than those three themselves.

00:20:30.410 --> 00:20:32.660
Ou Hon... Shin...!

00:20:40.080 --> 00:20:41.580
This is real fighting.

00:20:42.790 --> 00:20:44.660
So he's the type who pours on the power

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:47.370
according to his opponent's strength...

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:52.950
I suppose everyone's like that to some extent--

00:20:52.950 --> 00:20:55.950
but with this boy, it's like night and day.

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:02.620
And then

00:21:02.620 --> 00:21:05.040
there's the strange weight of this one blow...

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:09.250
Whoops!

00:21:09.250 --> 00:21:12.370
Dammit, Ou Hon! Get outta my way!

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:16.120
Get out of <i>my</i> way! He's mine!

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:19.040
Like hell he is!

00:21:19.040 --> 00:21:20.330
Rin Ko, sir!

00:21:28.830 --> 00:21:29.660
Rin Ko!

00:21:29.660 --> 00:21:32.850
I-Is he even human...?

00:21:36.080 --> 00:21:38.370
You sure are strong.

00:21:38.370 --> 00:21:42.950
I'm startin' to believe
you really did land a blow on Ou Ki.

00:21:42.950 --> 00:21:45.870
I'd rather you didn't make light of that.

00:21:47.870 --> 00:21:49.500
I mean,

00:21:49.500 --> 00:21:54.870
it's not like you know what it's like
to be up against Ou Ki.

00:21:56.120 --> 00:21:59.830
Who are you tryin' to kid? We know, all right.

00:21:59.830 --> 00:22:04.330
Hell, he's related to General Ou Ki.

00:22:04.330 --> 00:22:06.080
Related to--

00:22:06.080 --> 00:22:08.200
And you?

00:22:08.200 --> 00:22:13.620
Me? I'm the man who
inherited Ou Ki's poleax...

00:22:13.620 --> 00:22:16.000
...and his dying wish!

00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:21.950
And I'm the man who'll
surpass all those generals

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:25.910
to be the greatest general in all of history!

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:35.080
Ou Ki's poleax and his dying wish, eh?

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:40.790
And the greatest general in all of history?
Aren't <i>you</i> thinking big!

00:22:40.790 --> 00:22:45.290
Then you'll be surpassing my lord,
General Ren Pa.

00:22:45.290 --> 00:22:46.950
Obviously!

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:51.540
After I kill you, I'm goin'
straight for Ren Pa!

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:05.790
I do wish you wouldn't get so carried away.

00:23:06.910 --> 00:23:10.700
After all, your lives will be ending here today.

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:31.370
<i>I'm dreaming of you, just like back then</i>

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:39.830
<i>Trusting, unafraid of anything</i>

00:23:39.830 --> 00:23:48.080
<i>Your words that I always remember</i>

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:56.540
<i>Are getting fainter,</i>
<i>mixed up, about to disappear</i>

00:23:56.540 --> 00:24:01.500
<i>I go crazy trying to make them out</i>

00:24:01.500 --> 00:24:05.830
<i>Barefoot still, I'd lost my way</i>

00:24:05.830 --> 00:24:10.080
<i>It's okay to stop</i>

00:24:10.080 --> 00:24:14.250
<i>But even if I go after you,</i>
<i>if I hold out my hand</i>

00:24:14.250 --> 00:24:17.500
<i>Don't respond just yet</i>

00:24:17.500 --> 00:24:22.700
<i>But until I forget, don't change</i>

00:24:22.700 --> 00:24:26.870
<i>I ask this of you, and yet</i>

00:24:26.870 --> 00:24:34.200
<i>Like a long-awaited morning, it's starting again</i>

00:24:34.200 --> 00:24:37.700
<i>And I still remember</i>

00:24:52.000 --> 00:24:58.010
"Next Episode Preview"

00:25:02.000 --> 00:25:07.020
"A Wall to be Overcome"
